git merge feature-improved-scaling
git push origin main
```

### Step 6: Monitor and Validate

After merging, closely monitor the pipeline and deployments to ensure that the improvements do not cause any disruptions. Use monitoring tools like CloudWatch to track the success rate and other relevant metrics.

### Step 7: Gradual Rollout

If possible, gradually roll out the changes to a subset of your deployments before applying them to all environments. This allows you to catch any issues early and mitigate risks.

