#### Jenkinsfile Example

Here's an example of how you can configure your Jenkins pipeline to run the backup script, capture the success rate, and send an email if the success rate is below a specified threshold.

```groovy
pipeline {
    agent any

    environment {
        SUCCESS_THRESHOLD = 90
    }

    stages {
        stage('Build') {
            steps {
                sh 'mvn clean package'
            }
        }
